{"step_index":85,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-07T17:35:28Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-07T23:05:28+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-07T23:05:28+05:30\nShowing lines 615-725 of 1264\n615: \n616:     </section>\n617: \n618:     <!-- ========================================== -->\n619:     <!-- VIEW 5: VTU COMMUNITY PROJECT (1BCP308)   -->\n620:     <!-- ========================================== -->\n621:     <section id=\"view-project\" class=\"hidden max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6\">\n622:       \n623:       <!-- Academic Header -->\n624:       <div class=\"bg-govNavy text-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-lg border border-slate-700\">\n625:         <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-4 border-b border-slate-700\">\n626:           <div>\n627:             <span class=\"bg-amber-400 text-govNavy font-extrabold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">VTU CURRICULUM</span>\n628:             <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-serif mt-2\">Course: Community Project (1BCP308)</h2>\n629:             <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300\">Visvesvaraya Technological University, Belagavi, Karnataka</p>\n630:           </div>\n631:           <button onclick=\"window.print()\" class=\"bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/30 text-xs font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition flex items-center\">\n632:             <i class=\"fa-solid fa-print mr-1.5\"></i> Print Project Report Card\n633:           </button>\n634:         </div>\n635: \n636:         <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 text-xs\">\n637:           <div>\n638:             <p class=\"text-slate-400\">Project Domain</p>\n639:             <p class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm\">Smart Governance & Civic Tech</p>\n640:           </div>\n641:           <div>\n642:             <p class=\"text-slate-400\">Target Community</p>\n643:             <p class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm\">Local College Town / Urban Ward</p>\n644:           </div>\n645:           <div>\n646:             <p class=\"text-slate-400\">Sustainable Development Goals</p>\n647:             <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-400 text-sm\">SDG 11 & SDG 16</p>\n648:           </div>\n<truncated 3084 bytes>\novNavy font-serif\">4. Key Viva Questions Answered</h3>\n694:           </div>\n695:           <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n696:             <strong>Q: How is citizen privacy maintained?</strong><br>\n697:             A: The system only records public landmarks (e.g. Near Main Gate) and an optional citizen pseudonym. No private home address or mobile number is exposed on the public dashboard.\n698:           </p>\n699:         </div>\n700: \n701:       </div>\n702: \n703:     </section>\n704: \n705:   </main>\n706: \n707:   <!-- SUCCESS SUBMISSION MODAL -->\n708:   <div id=\"success-modal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n709:     <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-md w-full shadow-2xl text-center space-y-4 border border-slate-200 animate-in fade-in zoom-in duration-200\">\n710:       <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-3xl\">\n711:         <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i>\n712:       </div>\n713:       \n714:       <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-govNavy font-serif\">Grievance Successfully Lodged!</h3>\n715:       <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Your issue has been logged into the municipal dispatch queue.</p>\n716:       \n717:       <div class=\"bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-left space-y-1\">\n718:         <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-semibold\">Your Tracking Ticket ID:</p>\n719:         <p id=\"modal-ticket-id\" class=\"text-xl font-mono font-bold text-govNavy tracking-wider\">TKT-8942</p>\n720:         <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\">Save this code to check progress in the \"Track Status\" tab.</p>\n721:       </div>\n722: \n723:       <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n724:         <button onclick=\"copyTicketAndTrack()\" class=\"flex-1 bg-govNavy hover:bg-govNavyLight text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg text-xs transition\">\n725:           <i class=\"fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass mr-1\"></i> Track Ticket Now","truncated_fields":["content"]}
